<title>USA: Excel says to buy back up to 2.0 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Excel says to buy back up to 2.0 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS, Texas 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>EXCEL Communications Inc said on Thursday that its directors had authorized a common stock buy-back plan effective until May 23 for the repurchase of up to 2 million shares.</p>
<p>The company currently has about 108.8 million shares outstanding, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>The plan authorizes EXCEL to make repurchases at its discretion in the open market or through privately negotiated transactions, it added.</p>
<p>Dallas-based EXCEL Communications is a long distance company.</p>
